200 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (Horizon leverages deep learning to monitor high-frequency telemetry. By comparing the Live Stream against a Golden Digital Twin \(a perfect simulation of the asset's healthy state\), the system identifies deviations with 99.4% accuracy. It provides a 24-hour warning window before a critical component failure, allowing for pre-emptive scheduling of maintenance during planned downtime. This eliminates the unpredictability of production halts.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
201 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (PHASE 2: NEUTRALISE)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
202 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (When a risk \(either mechanical or cyber-related\) is detected, Sentinel AI acts as a digital immune cell. In a cyber-attack scenario, it automatically isolates the compromised robotic node in the metaverse and pushes a Virtual Patch to the physical controller. This Digital Air-Gap ensures that the risk is neutralized at the edge before it can propagate through the network, preventing a total factory halt. This response is automated, deterministic, and faster than human reaction times.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
203 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (PHASE 3: HEAL)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
204 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 103 0 R
/E (The final phase integrates human expertise. Healing is achieved through XR-guided remote intervention. A local technician, even with limited experience, dons an AR headset and receives a step-by-step digital overlay from a global expert sitting thousands of miles away. Once the physical repair is completed, the system Heals the digital twin by recalibrating its parameters to the new baseline, ensuring the system evolves to prevent repeat failures.)
/Pg 14 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
