/E (The primary risk is Adoption Inertia among conservative factory owners. We mitigate this through a Freemium Pilot Model, allowing OEMs to test the Predict layer with minimal upfront cost. Technological risks regarding latency are hedged by using BlackBerry's proprietary edge-computing nodes, ensuring that the P-N-H logic is executed locally, independent of cloud reliability. This ensures the system remains operational even during network outages.)
/Pg 17 0 R
/K [13]
>>
