/E (BlackBerry Horizon is a fundamental enabler of Sustainable Manufacturing. By enabling tele-presence repairs, we project a 70% reduction in carbon emissions from international expert travel. The Digital Twin also allows for Zero-Waste Prototyping, where thousands of iterations are tested digitally before a single piece of physical material is wasted. This directly aligns BlackBerry with UN SDG 9 \(Industry, Innovation, and Infrastructure\) and SDG 12 \(Responsible Consumption and Production\), demonstrating corporate leadership in the climate crisis.)
/Pg 18 0 R
/K [5]
>>
